senses.gloss:
माकर माकर, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. मकर),
related or belonging to the sea-monster Makara;
माकर आकर, ‘the mine of Makaras,’ the sea;
माकरम् आसनम्, a particular posture in sitting;
माकरो व्यूहः, a particular form of military array;
माकरी सप्तमी = मकर-सप्तमी, the seventh
day in the light half of the month Māgha.
